Replace this file with your real Firebase config.

1. Go to https://console.firebase.google.com and create a project (free).
2. Add an Android app inside it with package name: com.nadeemmobile.lock
3. Download the "google-services.json" file it gives you.
4. Put that real file at: android-app/app/google-services.json
   (same folder as this placeholder — delete this .example file or just
   make sure the real one is named exactly "google-services.json")

Without this file, the app will not build.
